        <mxCell id="dfd1_cap" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="Figure 3. Level 1 DFD. Six processes, nine data stores (one per ERD table) and five external entities. Each external entity is drawn on both sides (and a store is drawn once) so that arrows do not cross processes. Arrows show direction of flow; two-headed arrows mean read and write." vertex="1">
